<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Aug wholesale prices up 0.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austrian Aug wholesale prices up 0.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN WHOLESALE PRICES   August     July	 August 1995</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index change    -0.8	 -0.2	    -1.4</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change		  0.6	 -0.1	    -0.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    103.3	104.1	   102.7</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 254</p>
